  "passage": {
    "text": "Maria owns a small family farm near Kaunas. She grows potatoes and wheat, and she keeps ten dairy cows. Every day she works in the fields and in the barn. Yesterday she got up at five and milked the cows. But a farm is also a business. Maria sells her crops and her milk, and this is her income. She pays for fuel, fertilizer and animal feed, and these are her costs. The money she has at the end is her profit. This year her profit is bigger than last year. Next year she is going to buy a new tractor.",
